  text: {fileID: 1859790239534895823}
  gameUIController: {fileID: 0}
  robotBlocker: {fileID: 0}
  maxTutNumber: 4
  tutNumber: 0
  tutorial1: Move your Robot with A and D. Press Z for a quick attack and X for a
    heavy one.
  tutorial2: You can also jump with Space! Or crouch with Ctrl... Or block with C.
  tutorial3: Watch out for your Energy! You'll lose some every time you attack, so
    don't whiff!
